 g\, Control & Robotics\nSize: M\nSubmission type: Paper-based\nConfidence
 : confirmed\nLast checked date: 2026-10-06\nNotes: Annual IEICE NOLTA sym
 posium\; official final extensions supersede older April/July dates. Proc
